    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 23.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif se hund ma misdæda gewyrce, ⁊ he hine hæbbe, bete be fullan were swa dolgbote swa he wryce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the dog commits more misdeeds, and he keeps it, let [the owner] pay according to the full wer for any wound [the dog] inflicts.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If the dog commits more offences and he [its master] still keeps it, he must pay compensation for whatever wounds that may be inflicted, according to the amount of [the injured man's] full wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif se hund ma misdæda gewyrce, ⁊ he hine hæbbe, bete be fullan were swa dolhbote swa he gewryce.</ab>
      </div>
